<span>Elegant without trying.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">Impossible to forget.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#find\">Discover the right one</a><div class=\"proof\"><strong>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</strong> &nbsp; Over 10,000 fragrance lovers have chosen Magyx<small>Inspired by iconic luxury perfumes &#183; Long-lasting scent &#183; Made in Europe &#183; IFRA-approved</small></div></div></div></header><section class=\"split\"><img class=\"split-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp35_img_02.jpg?v=1785085742\" width=\"1774\" height=\"887\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Getting ready for the evening\"><div class=\"split-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">The final detail</div><h2>Most perfumes smell wonderful.<br><em>A few make you feel irresistible again.</em></h2><p class=\"body-lg\">We know exactly which ones they are. Because the same perfumes are mentioned again and again by customers who wanted to feel just like you.</p><p class=\"body-lg\">The right perfume isn't just another beauty product. It's the final detail that completes your look and makes you noticed with every step you take.</p></div></section><section class=\"section light\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Why some scents make a bigger impression</div><h2>Why do some scents get compliments...<br><em>...while others fade before you've even made it out the door?</em></h2></div><div class=\"grid3\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"num\">01</div><h3>Too little perfume oil</h3><p>Thinner formulations can contain as little as 5&#8211;15% fragrance concentration. That can mean weaker projection and a scent that disappears before the evening has even started.</p></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"num\">02</div><h3>Too much perfume oil</h3><p>Some intense perfumes can contain 40% fragrance concentration or more. Without the right balance, the scent can feel heavy and overwhelming instead of pleasant and inviting.</p></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"num\">03</div><h3>Cheaper ingredients</h3><p>Low-quality ingredients, or ones the skin doesn't tolerate well, can cause irritation, redness and rashes and give some people headaches.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section solution\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"intro\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">What sets Magyx apart from the crowd</div><h2>Perfumes created to spark curiosity</h2><p class=\"body-lg\">Magyx's scents are created by the same perfume experts behind some of the world's best-known perfumes. The same quality and longevity you expect from the big brands? <strong>We've got that.</strong></p><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Premium, inside and out</div></div><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature\"><b>21%+ perfume oil</b><p>True perfume strength for a noticeable scent with a long-lasting effect.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><b>Made in Europe</b><p>Made to high European quality standards.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><b>Made according to IFRA guidelines</b><p>Meets the world's leading safety standards for perfumes.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><b>Clean Label</b><p>No phthalates or parabens. (Remember: redness, irritation, headaches?) Fully transparent ingredient lists that are kinder to the skin.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><b>Vegan and cruelty-free</b><p>Made without animal ingredients and without animal testing.</p></div></div></div></section></div>",
