doftar-som-good-girl-no-183\">Add to cart</button></article><article class=\"product\"><img class=\"product-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp35_img_07.jpg?v=1785085742\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Magyx parfymflaska\"><h3>Inspired by Valentino Donna Born in Roma</h3><p class=\"notes\">Modern. Sophisticated. Unforgettable.</p><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;The scent is truly beautiful and stays on the skin all day.&#8221;</p><p class=\"buyer\">&#8212; Lyaba Cheladyn</p><div class=\"price\">175 kr</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn lp35-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660163051590\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-469w\">Add to cart</button></article><article class=\"product\"><img class=\"product-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp35_img_08.jpg?v=1785085742\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Magyx parfymflaska\"><h3>Inspired by Tom Ford Lost Cherry</h3><p class=\"notes\">Warm. Playful. Irresistible.</p><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;The quality is incredibly good. The scents are wonderful and last all day.&#8221;</p><p class=\"buyer\">&#8212; Nunna</p><div class=\"price\">175 kr</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn lp35-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660163608646\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-438w\">Add to cart</button></article><article class=\"product\"><img class=\"product-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp35_img_09.jpg?v=1785085742\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Magyx parfymflaska\"><h3>Inspired by YSL Libre</h3><p class=\"notes\">Elegant. Confident. Free.</p><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4,9/5</div><p class=\"review\">&#8220;Incredibly fresh, elegant and feminine, and surprisingly close to exclusive perfumes.&#8221;</p><p class=