      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ts-lp35\"><section class=\"section reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Don't just take our word for it</div><h2>Why customers love these scents</h2><p>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9/5 &#8212; Women looking for the same feeling loved these scents.</p></div><div class=\"reviews-grid\"><article class=\"review-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;The scent is incredibly creamy, powdery and very elegant. It smells luxurious and gets tons of compliments.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Dorota</cite></article><article class=\"review-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;The scent lasts much longer than I expected. I've already had several compliments when wearing it.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Alina Maier</cite></article><article class=\"review-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;Incredibly fresh, elegant and feminine, and surprisingly close to exclusive perfumes.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Lulu</cite></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section trust\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">What you're really paying for</div><h2>You pay for the scent.<br><em>Instead of the logo on the bottle.</em></h2><p class=\"body-lg\">Every Magyx fragrance is inspired by some of the world's most iconic luxury perfumes. Created by the same perfume experts behind some of the world's best-known perfumes. Made with the quality and performance people expect from a premium fragrance.</p><p class=\"body-lg\">The difference is in what you don't have to pay for.</p><div class=\"trust-list\"><div>The designer brand.</div><div>The celebrity campaigns.</div><div>The luxury packaging.</div><div>The retail markups.</div></div><p class=\"body-lg trust-note\"><strong>So paying less doesn't mean getting less.</strong></p></div></section><section class=\"offer\" id=\"offer\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp35_img_03.jpg?v=1785085742\" width=\"1900\" height=\"759\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Elegant middag\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"offer-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">The spark never went away</div><h2>Sometimes two &#8220;sprays&#8221; are all it takes to bring the feeling back.</h2><p class=\"statement\">You've seen what works. Now it's your turn.</p><p>Order today and get a free full-size Mystery Fragrance. So you can discover yet another new favorite.</p><a href=\"#find\" class=\"btn\">Find the right one</a></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Questions and answers</div><h2>FAQ</h2></div><details><summary>How long do the scents last?</summary><p>Our perfumes contain 21%+ perfume oil and give the long-lasting scent people expect from premium perfumes.</p></details><details><summary>Why are they so much cheaper?</summary><p>You pay for the scent itself. Not for the designer brand, the celebrity campaigns, the luxury packaging or everything else that drives up the price.</p></details><details><summary>Are they safe to use?</summary><p>Yes. Our scents are made in Europe, IFRA-approved and have a Clean Label formulation without phthalates or parabens. All ingredients are openly disclosed.</p></details><details><summary>What if I don't like the scent?</summary><p>You're covered by our 60-day money-back guarantee, so you can try it without worrying.</p></details><details><summary>Which scent should I choose?</summary><p>Start with the recommendations on this page. They're based on thousands of customer experiences from women who wanted more compliments, renewed confidence and scents that leave a lasting impression.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"section member\"><div class=\"wrap member-grid\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Signature Membership</div><h2>You don't wear the same clothes for every occasion.<br><em>Why wear the same perfume?</em></h2><ul class=\"checks\"><li>✓ Personal fragrance recommendations</li><li>&#10003; Member-exclusive launches and offers</li><li>&#10003; Seasonal favorites picked for you</li><li>✓ Exclusive member prices</li><li>&#10003; 2 bottles per month</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"price-lg\">149 kr/month</div><p>Limited number of new spots every month</p><div class=\"step\"><span>01</span><div><strong>Register your interest</strong><p>We'll let you know when a spot in the Signature Membership becomes available.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><span>02</span><div><strong>If you're offered a spot</strong><p>You'll get your first personal Signature recommendation and a welcome gift as a member.</p></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:28px\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#lp35-optin\">Apply for the Signature Membership</a></p><div id=\"lp35-optin\"><form class=\"optin-form\" method=\"post\" action=\"/contact#lp35-optin\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_type\" value=\"customer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"utf8\" value=\"&#10003;\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"return_to\" value=\"\" class=\"lp35-return-to\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"newsletter,LP35\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"contact[email]\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Join the list</button></form><p class=\"lp35-optin-ok\" hidden>Thanks! You're on the list.</p></div></div></div></section>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var SECTIONS='cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble';\n  function drawerEl(){return document.querySelector('cart-drawer');}\n  function closeDrawer(d){\n    if(typeof d.close==='function'){d.close();}\n    else{d.classList.remove('active');document.body.classList.remove('overflow-hidden');}\n  }\n  function applySections(sec){\n    var d=drawerEl();\n    if(!d)return false;\n    if(typeof d.renderContents==='function'){\n      try{d.renderContents({sections:sec});return true;}catch(err){}\n    }\n    if(!sec||!sec['cart-drawer'])return false;\n    var t=document.createElement('div');t.innerHTML=sec['cart-drawer'];\n    var inner=t.querySelector('cart-drawer');\n    if(!inner)return false;\n    d.innerHTML=inner.innerHTML;\n    d.className=inner.className;\n    var ov=d.querySelector('#CartDrawer-Overlay');\n    if(ov)ov.addEventListener('click',function(){closeDrawer(d);});\n    if(typeof d.open==='function'){d.open();}\n    else{d.classList.add('animate','active');document.body.classList.add('overflow-hidden');}\n    return true;\n  }\n  function fetchAndOpen(){\n    fetch('/?sections='+SECTIONS)\n      .then(function(r){return r.json()})\n      .then(function(sec){if(!applySections(sec))window.location.href='/cart';})\n      .catch(function(){window.location.href='/cart';});\n  }\n  document.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    var cartBtn=e.target.closest('.lp35-cart');\n    if(cartBtn){e.preventDefault();fetchAndOpen();return;}\n    var btn=e.target.closest('.lp35-atc');\n    if(!btn)return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var vid=btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');\n    var orig=btn.innerHTML;\n    btn.disabled=true;btn.innerHTML='Adding...';\n    fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},\n      body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:parseInt(vid,10),quantity:1}],sections:SECTIONS,sections_url:window.location.pathname})})\n      .then(function(r){if(!r.ok)throw new Error('add failed');return r.json()})\n      .then(function(data){\n        btn.innerHTML='Tillagd \\u2713';\n        if(!applySections(data&&data.sections))fetchAndOpen();\n        setTimeout(function(){btn.innerHTML=orig;btn.disabled=false;},1500);\n      })\n      .catch(function(){\n        btn.disabled=false;btn.innerHTML=orig;\n        window.location.href='/products/'+btn.getAttribute('data-handle');\n      });\n  });\n  var rt=document.querySelector('.lp35-return-to');\n  if(rt)rt.value=window.location.pathname+'?customer_posted=true#lp35-optin';\n  if(/[?&]customer_posted=true/.test(window.location.search)){\n    var box=document.getElementById('lp35-optin');\n    if(box){\n      var f=box.querySelector('form');if(f)f.hidden=true;\n      var ok=box.querySelector('.lp35-optin-ok');if(ok)ok.hidden=false;\n      box.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});\n    }\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n\n</div>",
